title: MarvinDay1Afternoon
---
Marvin: Hey, I was wondering if we could get lunch together.
<<if $Marvin_likePoint >= 1>>
    Marvin: We seem to be getting along after all.
<<endif>>
<<if $Shelly_inviteToLunch>>
    Me: Actually, someone has already invited me to lunch as well.
    Me: Wanna come along?
    <<if $Marvin_quirkPoint >= 1>>
        Marvin: Yeahhh, I'll gladly come along.
    <<else>>
        Marvin: Ok, I'll come along.
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    Me: Yeah, sure!
    <<if $Marvin_quirkPoint >= 1>>
        Marvin: Hehe Ok, let's go.
    <<else>>
        Marvin: Ok, let's go.
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
<<set $Marvin_hasSpokenTo = true>>
<<play_crossfade_normal>>
<<change_objective "Go to the cafeteria">>
<<set_object_inactive Afternoon_Marvin1 false>>
<<set_object_active "Afternoon_Marvin2" false>>
<<if $Shelly_inviteToLunch>>
    <<set_object_active "Afternoon_Shelly" false>>
<<endif>>
===
